{"html": "<section class=\"ec-product-scenarios ec-library-detail-section\" id=\"product-use-scenarios\" data-scene-ver=\"7\" aria-labelledby=\"product-scenario-title\"><p class=\"ec-scenario-kicker\">用途与选型</p><h2 id=\"product-scenario-title\">适用场景建议</h2><p class=\"ec-scenario-role\">2 oz 亚克力 LED 烈酒杯型</p><div class=\"ec-scenario-grid\"><article class=\"ec-scenario-card\"><h3><a href=\"/zh/open-air-nightclub/\">户外酒吧 <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></h3><p>2 oz 亚克力小杯身，杯底带灯。一轮 shots 端出去整排亮着，客人自己会拍。</p></article><article class=\"ec-scenario-card\"><h3><a href=\"/zh/tailgate-party-cups/\">尾箱与汽车派对 <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></h3><p>开赛前一轮亮着的 shots，比喊口号管用。</p></article><article class=\"ec-scenario-card\"><h3><a href=\"/zh/yacht-party-cups/\">游艇派对 <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></h3><p>杯小不占地方，一盒收在抽屉里。</p></article></div><div class=\"ec-scenario-check\"><h3>项目确认</h3><p>核对出杯速度、叠放收纳与夜间照明条件；场地容器规定、单杯份量与车载携带方式；甲板防滑、杯型稳定与船方容器规定。</p></div><p class=\"ec-scenario-note\">以上为选型建议。请按实际用途审核所选配置与样品。</p><a class=\"ec-scenario-cta\" href=\"/zh/contact/?models=FGB-016\">讨论 FGB-016 的应用方案 →</a></section>", "kind": "product"}